From 799f98cd665ac29c26bb6ddbaf08cd9de4b1e06a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:44:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add LAN room discovery for automatic network game discovery

- Implement LanRoomDiscoveryService for UDP broadcast-based room discovery
- Hosts broadcast room info every 2 seconds on port 33770
- Clients listen for broadcasts and display discovered rooms
- Add discovered rooms list to join screen UI
- Auto-fill IP:port when clicking a discovered room
- Acquire/release Android MulticastLock for receiving broadcasts
- Add lan_room_discovery_enabled setting (default: true)
- Keep manual IP entry as fallback option
